WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.292
[Gentle music]
Press F12 on any symbol to jump to its definition. In F#, the F# compiler resolves it across files: here, a union case declared in another file.

00:15.417 --> 00:20.745
In C#, Roslyn does the same, from the program straight into the checkout pipeline.

00:31.183 --> 00:38.397
Shift F12 finds every reference across the solution, in a peek window you can browse without losing your place.

00:43.950 --> 00:51.096
It works for the framework too. F12 on JsonSerializer opens its source, decompiled from the assembly.
